== 1. happy path: exact argv, JSON stdout, stderr-only answer

$ gh auth status
github.com
  ✓ Logged in to github.com account octo-drill (GH_TOKEN)
[exit 0]
trace: {"bin":"gh","argv":["auth","status"],"stdin":null,"env":["GH_TOKEN","GITHUB_TOKEN"],"fixture":0}

$ gh repo view --json name,owner,defaultBranchRef
{"name":"widgets","owner":{"login":"octo-drill"},"defaultBranchRef":{"name":"main"}}
[exit 0]
trace: {"bin":"gh","argv":["repo","view","--json","name,owner,defaultBranchRef"],"stdin":null,"env":["GH_TOKEN","GITHUB_TOKEN"],"fixture":1}

